Subject: mt7915: keep proven-stop recovery alive and trace the NPU path

Keep recovery alive after a proven DMA stop with bounded exponential backoff,
reserve the permanent failure latch for NPU quarantine, and add low-rate
snapshots for control, radio, recovery, PPE and TX datapath transitions.

